{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftPreprocessing\/documentation\/SwiftPreprocessing"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Understand how SwiftSci automatically routes workloads between CPU (Accelerate\/AMX\/NEON) and Metal GPU (MLX) with strict concurrency safety."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftpreprocessing\/hardwarerouterandmemory"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiftPreprocessing\/documentation\/SwiftPreprocessing\/HardwareRouterAndMemory"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SwiftPreprocessing"}],"roleHeading":"API Collection","title":"Hardware Routing & Unified Memory Governance","role":"collectionGroup"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Apple Silicon features a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Unified Memory Architecture (UMA)"}]},{"type":"text","text":" where the CPU, GPU, and Apple Neural Engine (ANE) share a single high-bandwidth memory pool. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiftPreprocessing"},{"type":"text","text":" provides intelligent hardware routing and memory reservation primitives to prevent GPU saturation and avoid data copying."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"1. The Hardware Router","anchor":"1-The-Hardware-Router"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HardwareRouter"},{"type":"text","text":" assesses tensor dimensions and operation complexity to select the optimal computing engine:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"mermaid","code":["graph TD","    Op[Compute Operation] --> Router{HardwareRouter}","    Router -->|Small \/ Vector < 50k| CPU[Accelerate \/ AMX \/ NEON]","    Router -->|Large Matrix \/ Autodiff| GPU[MLX Metal GPU]","    Router -->|Static Inference| ANE[Core ML Engine]"]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Small Vectors (","type":"text"},{"code":"N < 50,000","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Routed to CPU Accelerate (vDSP\/BLAS\/LAPACK) to eliminate GPU kernel dispatch latency.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Large Tensors & Deep Learning","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Routed to MLX Metal GPU for massive parallel throughput.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"2. WiredMemoryManager & Ticket System","anchor":"2-WiredMemoryManager--Ticket-System"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To prevent out-of-memory (OOM) conditions during concurrent analytical workloads, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WiredMemoryManager"},{"type":"text","text":" implements an asynchronous FIFO reservation system:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import SwiftPreprocessing","","\/\/ Acquire a GPU execution slot","let ticket = try await WiredMemoryManager.shared.reserveMemory(estimatedBytes: 64 * 1024 * 1024)","","\/\/ Execute heavy MLX operations","\/\/ ...","","\/\/ Automatically flushes GPU caches upon completion","await ticket.release()"]}]}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftPreprocessing\/documentation\/SwiftPreprocessing\/HardwareRouter","doc:\/\/SwiftPreprocessing\/documentation\/SwiftPreprocessing\/WiredMemoryManager","doc:\/\/SwiftPreprocessing\/documentation\/SwiftPreprocessing\/WiredMemoryTicket"],"title":"Memory & Routing APIs","anchor":"Memory--Routing-APIs"}],"kind":"article","references":{"doc://SwiftPreprocessing/documentation/SwiftPreprocessing/WiredMemoryTicket":{"title":"WiredMemoryTicket","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WiredMemoryTicket","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftPreprocessing\/documentation\/SwiftPreprocessing\/WiredMe